    <string name="help_title">Install help</string>
    <string name="help_body">1. The installer checks storage and target game status first.\n2. After download completes, confirm installation or update.\n3. Android 8 and above require permission to install unknown apps.\n4. When the system install confirmation appears, follow the prompt to continue.</string>
    <string name="help_note">If installation fails, check network connection, storage, device architecture, and installed-version signature. The failure page’s “Show details” button shows the specific reason returned by the system.</string>
